<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the other teachings used improperly</l><l>Are the “winds of doctrine,” spoiling unity:</l><l>Blowing saints away from Christ who is the Head,</l><l>Building not the Body, tearing down instead.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thus we must relinquish doctrines of all kinds,</l><l>Only keep the faith that oneness we may find.</l><l>In the Lord the Spirit we are one indeed;</l><l>Just to keep this oneness is our only need.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Truth we must be holding, which is Christ Himself,</l><l>That we be delivered from the sects of self,</l><l>That in all things growing into Christ the Head,</l><l>Built will be the Body and to fulness led.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>To the “unity of faith” we must attain,</l><l>All the “winds of doctrine” evermore disdain;</l><l>Holding Christ the Spirit, our reality,</l><l>For the Body’s growing in its unity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
